  RECIPIENT_DISPUTE
  // TEAM-ANSWERS G3 (OPEN DECISIONS item 15, driver side) — a driver's
  // incident report about a finished ride. The tenth conflict type, and
  // deliberately a conflict rather than a score: it gives ops the same
  // pattern visibility a passenger rating would (repeated reports about
  // one rider are plainly visible in this dashboard) without creating a
  // number attached to a person's ability to move through their city.
